 "title": "Cheddar Lentil Loaded Sweet Potatoes with Garlic Yogurt",
 "summary": "Roasted sweet potatoes piled with spiced lentils, black beans and melted cheddar, topped with a cool garlicky yogurt sauce.",
 "ingredients": [
  "4 sweet potatoes",
  "1 cup brown lentils, rinsed",
  "2 ½ cups water",
  "1 tbsp olive oil",
  "1 onion, diced",
